[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0010","text":"是，伴……伴舞吗！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0020","text":"对！下次的FES\n她们答应给我们伴舞了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0030","text":"伴舞啊……\n感觉会是一场很棒的演出"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0040","text":"好像也有和美琴合作过的舞者\n在里头呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0050","text":"会是谁呢……没有理由拒绝吧？\n我觉得会很有意思"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0060","text":"……！\n是、是的……！好厉害啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0070","text":"哦\n日花也没问题吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0080","text":"诶……\n当、当然……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0090","text":"实力派组合──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0001","text":"舞蹈教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0002","text":"舞者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0100","text":"那么，就从最基本的开始"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0102","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0103","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0104","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0105","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0110","text":"好～！先休息一下～！\n接下来要从合拍开始哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0120","text":"美琴──\n合拍之前先稍微开个会，可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0130","text":"当然\n是不是副歌那部分？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0140","text":"是吗！不愧是美琴\n那个啊────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0149","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0142","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0150","text":"──我们这边加点动作怎么样？\n比如挥鞭转之类的────像这样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0160","text":"我觉得很好\n完全没问题"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0170","text":"绯田小姐热身指示也很到位嘛\n这个现场超好干的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0180","text":"不愧是被称为“实力派”\n水平真高"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0190","text":"────……喝口水吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_01_0200","text":"…………"}]
